  "name": "727 EPR (3 in a row)",
  "author": "FIPinator 3000",
  "description": "Boeing 727 EPR: engines 1, 2 and 3 side by side, as on the 727\u0027s panel. The right knob sets all three EPR bugs together (FSS 727; FIPinator Live).",
